Flyway is for data migration, alternative to hibernate which we have set
to 'none' in application.properties of orderService project

whenever Flyway is running it will look in "db_migration"
folder for database migration scripts

and files inside this folder "db_migration" should follow naming convention->
V<number>__<name>.sql

for example-
V1__myname.sql
V23__soname.sql

flyway is for versioning or database, just like code base is versioned
using git

